    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6600K, AMD 2600X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770, AMD Radeon 560; 4GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum average sustained frame rate of 30fps or better achieved on hardware combinations in this min-spec range.  Your experience may vary based on a variety of factors.  Broadband internet connection required for multiplayer features.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-5930K or AMD 3600X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or better; AMD Radeon 580 or better; 4GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game runs well on most common gaming configurations within the past 4-5 years (GTX 1060-era and beyond).  Broadband internet connection required for multiplayer features.</li></ul>"
